    "detailed_description": "<strong>Experience the groundbreaking thrill of soccer (football) in virtual reality! No internet connection required.</strong><br><br><strong>Mount controller on your foot (or use hands) and step into the ultimate VR soccer experience!</strong> Soccer VR lets you dominate the pitch like never before. Play full matches against challenging AI opponents. Choose from three difficulty levels and a variety of formations to test your skills.<br><br><strong>Master every aspect of the game. </strong> Hone your technique in dedicated practice modes, from penalties and free kicks to precision passing and powerful volleys. Face off against goalkeepers or take on target-based challenges to truly push your limits.<br><br><strong>Unparalleled Comfort.</strong> Optimized movement mechanics minimize the potential for VR-induced discomfort. Adjustable difficulty allows you to tailor the pace to your preference, ensuring a smooth and immersive gameplay experience.<br><br><strong>Freedom on the Field. </strong> Embrace a gameplay style that suits you.  This simulation prioritizes enjoyment over rigid rules, empowering you to define your own soccer journey.<br><br><strong>Prepare for Victory: </strong> Before entering the virtual field, we recommend familiarizing yourself with our comprehensive Tips &amp; Tricks and Tutorial resources.<br><br><strong>Embrace the Future of Soccer: Immerse yourself today!</strong><br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Yes, you can kick with your foot, just ensure you have enough space and follow tutorial in game<br></li><li> Game prioritizes enjoyment over rigid rules and we value user voice. You can suggest improvements in our Discord channel</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Experience the groundbreaking thrill of soccer (football) in virtual reality! No internet connection required.</strong><br><br><strong>Mount controller on your foot (or use hands) and step into the ultimate VR soccer experience!</strong> Soccer VR lets you dominate the pitch like never before. Play full matches against challenging AI opponents. Choose from three difficulty levels and a variety of formations to test your skills.<br><br><strong>Master every aspect of the game. </strong> Hone your technique in dedicated practice modes, from penalties and free kicks to precision passing and powerful volleys. Face off against goalkeepers or take on target-based challenges to truly push your limits.<br><br><strong>Unparalleled Comfort.</strong> Optimized movement mechanics minimize the potential for VR-induced discomfort. Adjustable difficulty allows you to tailor the pace to your preference, ensuring a smooth and immersive gameplay experience.<br><br><strong>Freedom on the Field. </strong> Embrace a gameplay style that suits you.  This simulation prioritizes enjoyment over rigid rules, empowering you to define your own soccer journey.<br><br><strong>Prepare for Victory: </strong> Before entering the virtual field, we recommend familiarizing yourself with our comprehensive Tips &amp; Tricks and Tutorial resources.<br><br><strong>Embrace the Future of Soccer: Immerse yourself today!</strong><br><br><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Yes, you can kick with your foot, just ensure you have enough space and follow tutorial in game<br></li><li> Game prioritizes enjoyment over rigid rules and we value user voice. You can suggest improvements in our Discord channel</li></ul>",
